Package: bams
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: BAMS <noreply@github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, ffmpeg, systemd, passwd
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/TomSomerville/bams
Description: BAMS - Bad Ass Media Server
 A self-hosted, Netflix/Plex-style server for your own movies, TV shows and
 music. Point it at your folders; it identifies the media (TMDB, MusicBrainz),
 fetches posters and descriptions and streams to any browser on your network.
 Media folders are read-only to BAMS, enforced by systemd.
 .
 After installing, open http://localhost:8484 on this computer.
